<http://data.silknow.org/object/992a46ce-2ee9-36d9-8ca1-3be051940633>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "On a cream-colored silk satin ground, continuous undulating, leafy vines brocaded in gilded silver wire wound on a silk core.  Floral sprays growing out of them, brocaded in tinsel wound on a silk core and polychrome silks.  Selvedge on one side with five cords and three narrow stripes.  Very soiled, worn, with holes."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/351fe980-6117-355b-91dc-43416f3c9ae7> ;
